WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Welcome to Dijkstra's Single-Source Shortest Path Algorithm (SSSP).

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Initialization: Source node A set to distance 0, other nodes set to infinity.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Greedy choice: Extract min node A (d=0). Relax outgoing edges A->B (4) and A->C (2).

4
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Node C has min dist 2. Relax C->B (2+1=3 < 4, updated!) and C->E (2+8=10).

5
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Node B has min dist 3. Relax B->D (3+5=8). Complexity with Min-Heap is O((V+E) log V).

6
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Crucial rule: Non-negative weights required! If negative edges exist, use Bellman-Ford.

7
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Final Shortest Path Tree locked! Powers OSPF internet routing and Google Maps GPS.
